</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-IN" sz="3200" b="1" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="TextBox 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{D88E937B-6C93-9A95-254E-D328F89CD0AC}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="38100" y="1295400"/><a:ext cx="9067800" cy="2308324"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/>
    <a:p>
      <a:pPr marL="285750" indent="-285750">
      <a:buFont typeface="Wingdings" panose="05000000000000000000" pitchFamily="2" charset="2"/>
      <a:buChar char="ü"/>
    </a:pPr>
      <a:r>
        <a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1500" dirty="0"/>
        <a:t>Database Schema (NoSQL Firestore): Modeled around denormalized collections to maximize read efficiency: /events (metadata &amp; seats), /registrations (billing &amp; tickets), and /participants (profiles).</a:t>
      </a:r>
    </a:p>
    <a:p>
      <a:pPr marL="285750" indent="-285750">
      <a:buFont typeface="Wingdings" panose="05000000000000000000" pitchFamily="2" charset="2"/>
      <a:buChar char="ü"/>
    </a:pPr>
      <a:r>
        <a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1500" dirty="0"/>
        <a:t>Atomic Reservation Lock: Engineered Firebase client transactions (runTransaction) that fetch, verify, and decrement seat limits atomically to handle concurrent registration requests safely.</a:t>
      </a:r>
    </a:p>
    <a:p>
      <a:pPr marL="285750" indent="-285750">
      <a:buFont typeface="Wingdings" panose="05000000000000000000" pitchFamily="2" charset="2"/>
      <a:buChar char="ü"/>
    </a:pPr>
      <a:r>
        <a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1500" dirty="0"/>
        <a:t>Automated Ticket Dispatches: Configured a client-side EmailJS integration that triggers upon transaction approval, compiling verification codes and QR ticket payloads directly to student email boxes.</a:t>
      </a:r>
    </a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="1085314951"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>